"<main role=\"main\" aria-label=\"Premium Health Checkup - Comprehensive Health Screening\" class=\"min-h-screen bg-white\"><section class=\"relative min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-900 via-indigo-900 to-blue-900\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black/30\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center text-white py-32\"><div style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><p class=\"text-lg text-blue-200 mb-4 tracking-wider\">健康体检项目</p><h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold mb-6\">高端国际健康体检</h1><p class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl text-blue-200 mb-4\">Premium International Health Screening</p><p class=\"text-lg text-gray-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-4\">臻享全景·全方位套餐</p><p class=\"text-base text-gray-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8\">专为来华高端人士打造 | 一次体检·六大深筛·全程隐私无忧</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 mb-8\"><span class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 rounded-full text-sm\">全球尖端设备</span><span class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 rounded-full text-sm\">AI辅助诊断</span><span class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 rounded-full text-sm\">当日出报告</span><span class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 rounded-full text-sm\">全程隐私保护</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4\"><button class=\"px-8 py-4 bg-blue-500 text-white font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-blue-600 transition-colors\">查看套餐</button><button class=\"px-8 py-4 border-2 border-white text-white font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors\">了解更多</button></div></div></div></section><section id=\"intro\" class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center\"><div style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-30px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-6\">为什么选择来中国做体检？</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-lg mb-6\">中国顶级医疗中心现已配备全球同步的尖端设备、AI辅助诊断系统。</p><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-6\">您可以将年度深度体检与奢华旅行完美结合，最快上午体检、下午出报告、即刻专家解读，其余时间尽享旅程。</p><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-4 text-blue-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle \"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"font-semibold\">精密体检+高端旅行一站完成</span></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-slate-50\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">核心优势</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">为什么选择我们的高端健康体检服务</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-microscope \"><path d=\"M6 18h8\"></path><path d=\"M3 22h18\"></path><path d=\"M14 22a7 7 0 1 0 0-14h-1\"></path><path d=\"M9 14h2\"></path><path d=\"M9 12a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6h6v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2Z\"></path><path d=\"M12 6V3a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H9a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v3\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">全球同步尖端设备</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600\">配备256排512层能谱CT、3.0T超高场强磁共振、全数字化PET-CT、AI辅助诊断系统，微小病灶检出率提高50%。</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6\"><svg width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"23\"></line><path d=\"M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">费用优势显著</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600\">同等质量的体检套餐，中国大陆定价仅为美国的35%-45%。</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock \"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"></polyline></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">极致效率体验</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600\">全流程预约制，核心检查当天出报告，专家解读同日完成。最快上午体检、下午出报告、即刻专家解读。</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield \"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">隐私保护第一</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600\">VIP独立检区与常规区域完全分离，一对一私密沟通，男女分区，健康数据最高等级加密。</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">适合人群</h2></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><div class=\"bg-blue-50 rounded-xl p-6 flex items-start gap-4\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-blue-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 text-sm font-bold\">1</div><p class=\"text-gray-700\">全球企业高管、企业家、高净值家族成员</p></div><div class=\"bg-blue-50 rounded-xl p-6 flex items-start gap-4\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-blue-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 text-sm font-bold\">2</div><p class=\"text-gray-700\">年龄30-65岁，关注心血管、骨骼、肿瘤及消化道健康</p></div><div class=\"bg-blue-50 rounded-xl p-6 flex items-start gap-4\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-blue-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 text-sm font-bold\">3</div><p class=\"text-gray-700\">长期伏案、高压工作，存在颈椎/腰椎健康困扰</p></div><div class=\"bg-blue-50 rounded-xl p-6 flex items-start gap-4\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-blue-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 text-sm font-bold\">4</div><p class=\"text-gray-700\">有肿瘤、心脑血管疾病或消化道疾病家族史</p></div><div class=\"bg-blue-50 rounded-xl p-6 flex items-start gap-4\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-blue-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 text-sm font-bold\">5</div><p class=\"text-gray-700\">希望将精密体检+高端旅行一站完成，并极度重视隐私与效率</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-slate-900 text-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4\">核心定制体系：\"1+X+Y\"</h2><p class=\"text-gray-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">基础必查核心包 + 六大深度筛查模块 + 个性化延展模块</p></div><div class=\"mb-12\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-blue-400 mb-6\">\"1\" – 基础必查核心包</h3><div class=\"bg-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-8\"><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-blue-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm\">一般检查（身高/体重/BMI、血压、脉搏）</p></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-blue-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm\">内科、外科、眼科、耳鼻喉科、口腔科物理检查</p></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-blue-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm\">常规化验：血常规、尿常规+尿沉渣、便潜血</p></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-blue-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm\">生化全项：肝功能12项、肾功能5项、血脂8项（含ApoA、ApoB、ApoE、Lp(a)）、空腹血糖+糖化血红蛋白</p></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-blue-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm\">心肌损伤：肌钙蛋白、心肌酶谱</p></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-blue-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm\">免疫与炎症：风湿三项、免疫球蛋白、超敏C反应蛋白</p></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-blue-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm\">传染病筛查：乙肝/丙肝/梅毒/HIV</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mb-12\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-blue-400 mb-6\">\"X\" – 六大深度筛查模块</h3><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><div class=\"bg-slate-800 rounded-xl p-6\"><h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-4 text-white\">1. 心血管深度筛查</h4><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>256排512层能谱CT冠脉CTA</li><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>CT-FFR功能学评估（无创判断心肌缺血，准确率&gt;95%）</li><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>心脏彩超+三维重建</li><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>24小时动态心电图（可选）、动脉硬化检测</li><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>颈动脉彩超+内膜中层厚度(IMT)测定</li><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>心肌酶谱、肌钙蛋白、同型半胱氨酸</li></ul></div><div class=\"bg-slate-800 rounded-xl p-6\"><h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-4 text-white\">2. 脑血管深度筛查</h4><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>3.0T超高场强磁共振头颅MRI平扫+DWI</li><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>头颅MRA（血管狭窄、动脉瘤、畸形）</li><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>颈动脉斑块稳定性评估、经颅多普勒(TCD)</li><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>阿尔茨海默病相关蛋白+APOE基因分型</li><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>脑波压力分析+认知功能量表</li></ul></div><div class=\"bg-slate-800 rounded-xl p-6\"><h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-4 text-white\">3. 颈椎与腰椎深度筛查</h4><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>70cm大孔径3.0T科研型磁共振颈椎MRI、腰椎MRI</li><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>双能X线骨密度(DXA)–全身+脊柱+髋部</li><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>骨质疏松三项血清标志物（25-OH维生素D、TRAP 5b、CTX-I）</li></ul></div><div class=\"bg-slate-800 rounded-xl p-6\"><h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-4 text-white\">4. 膝关节/骨关节深度筛查</h4><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>膝关节MRI（半月板、韧带、软骨、髌股关节）</li><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>骨密度+骨质病变评估</li><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>关节功能综合评估（活动度、步态分析）</li><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>维生素D、K等骨代谢关键指标</li></ul></div><div class=\"bg-slate-800 rounded-xl p-6\"><h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-4 text-white\">5. 肿瘤深度筛查</h4><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>全套肿瘤标志物（CEA、AFP、CA19-9、CA125、PSA等）</li><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>七种肺癌自身抗体+VEGF</li><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>低剂量胸部螺旋CT–肺癌早筛金标准</li><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>全数字化PET-CT全身扫描或3.0T全身弥散加权成像</li><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>液体活检多癌种早筛（ctDNA甲基化分析）</li><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>全外显子组测序(WES)</li></ul></div><div class=\"bg-slate-800 rounded-xl p-6\"><h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-4 text-white\">6. 消化道深度筛查</h4><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>无痛舒眠胃肠镜（进口麻醉，息肉可同步切除）</li><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>或磁控胶囊胃镜（无创无痛）</li><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>C13/C14呼气试验（幽门螺杆菌）</li><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>粪便SDC2基因甲基化检测（肠癌早筛）</li></ul></div></div></div><div><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-blue-400 mb-6\">\"Y\" – 个性化延展模块（按需选配）</h3><div class=\"bg-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-8\"><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"text-blue-400 font-bold\">+</span><p class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm\">功能医学整合分析（维生素群、氨基酸谱、微量元素、肠道菌群）</p></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"text-blue-400 font-bold\">+</span><p class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm\">过敏原全项（吸入性17项+食物性14项）</p></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"text-blue-400 font-bold\">+</span><p class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm\">自身免疫疾病筛查（抗核抗体谱）</p></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"text-blue-400 font-bold\">+</span><p class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm\">心血管药物基因检测</p></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"text-blue-400 font-bold\">+</span><p class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm\">宫颈癌PAX1/JAM3基因甲基化检测</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">一站式贵宾服务流程</h2></div><div class=\"space-y-8\"><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-8\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-6\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-blue-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg\">1</div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E]\">来华前–专属定制</h3></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-lg p-4 shadow-sm\"><p class=\"text-gray-700 text-sm\">专属健康顾问远程沟通</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-lg p-4 shadow-sm\"><p class=\"text-gray-700 text-sm\">在线健康问卷+AI风险评估</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-lg p-4 shadow-sm\"><p class=\"text-gray-700 text-sm\">生成\"1+X+Y\"个性化方案</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-lg p-4 shadow-sm\"><p class=\"text-gray-700 text-sm\">协助办理医疗签证邀请函</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-8\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-6\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-blue-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg\">2</div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E]\">体检当日–高效奢华</h3></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-lg p-4 shadow-sm\"><p class=\"text-gray-700 text-sm\">VIP独立检区，与常规区域完全分离</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-lg p-4 shadow-sm\"><p class=\"text-gray-700 text-sm\">一对一全程陪检（英文流利健康顾问）</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-lg p-4 shadow-sm\"><p class=\"text-gray-700 text-sm\">男女分区+独立诊室</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-lg p-4 shadow-sm\"><p class=\"text-gray-700 text-sm\">智能导诊系统规划最短动线</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-lg p-4 shadow-sm\"><p class=\"text-gray-700 text-sm\">优雅休息室：柔软沙发、精致茶点</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-8\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-6\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-blue-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg\">3</div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E]\">检后–即时与长期</h3></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-lg p-4 shadow-sm\"><p class=\"text-gray-700 text-sm\">当天出具初步报告+主任级专家一对一解读</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-lg p-4 shadow-sm\"><p class=\"text-gray-700 text-sm\">MDT多学科会诊（针对复杂异常）</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-lg p-4 shadow-sm\"><p class=\"text-gray-700 text-sm\">重大阳性绿色通道</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-lg p-4 shadow-sm\"><p class=\"text-gray-700 text-sm\">终身电子健康档案</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"packages\" class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-slate-50\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">套餐版本与费用</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">选择适合您的体检套餐</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl p-8 bg-white shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-2\">尊享版</h3><div class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-6 text-blue-600\">$2,500 – $4,800</div><ul class=\"space-y-3\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-blue-500\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm\">基础包+六大深筛全项</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-blue-500\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm\">冠脉CTA、膝关节MRI</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-blue-500\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm\">APOE基因、动脉硬化检测</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-blue-500\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm\">无痛胃肠镜/胶囊胃镜二选一</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-blue-500\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm\">PET-CT（依风险评估）</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl p-8 bg-blue-600 text-white shadow-xl\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-2\">至臻版</h3><div class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-6 text-white\">$4,800 – $8,000</div><ul class=\"space-y-3\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-blue-200\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm\">尊享版全部内容</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-blue-200\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm\">CT-FFR功能学评估</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-blue-200\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm\">液体活检多癌种早筛</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-blue-200\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm\">全外显子组测序</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-blue-200\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm\">全身PET-CT</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-blue-200\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm\">入住式VIP体验</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-blue-200\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm\">全年健康管理</span></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"text-center mt-12 bg-blue-100 rounded-2xl p-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">费用优势</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600\">同等质量的体检套餐，中国大陆定价仅为美国的35%-45%。</p><p class=\"text-gray-500 text-sm mt-4\">*具体费用以医院最终评估为准。</p></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">国际医疗旅行无缝支持</h2></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8\"><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-plane \"><path d=\"M17.8 19.2 16 11l3.5-3.5C21 6 21.5 4 21 3c-1-.5-3 0-4.5 1.5L13 8 4.8 6.2c-.5-.1-.9.1-1.1.5l-.3.5c-.2.5-.1 1 .3 1.3L9 12l-2 3H4l-1 1 3 2 2 3 1-1v-3l3-2 3.5 5.3c.3.4.8.5 1.3.3l.5-.2c.4-.3.6-.7.5-1.2z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">签证协助</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">提供正式医疗邀请函，支持医疗签证申请</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-globe \"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h20\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">语言服务</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">全程英文协调员（其他语种可提前预约）</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin \"><path d=\"M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12s-8-6-8-12a8 8 0 0 1 16 0Z\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">交通住宿</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">机场接送、高端酒店合作价</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-award \"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle><path d=\"M15.477 12.89 17 22l-5-3-5 3 1.523-9.11\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">旅行延展</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">可定制文化或休闲行程</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-blue-900 text-white\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center\"><div style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-6\">开启您的\"体检+旅行\"臻享之旅</h2><p class=\"text-blue-200 mb-8\">一次深度体检，六大维度洞察，全周期健康守护。将年度健康管理变成一场身心焕新的奢华旅程。</p><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4\"><a href=\"mailto:contact@medkungfu.com\" class=\"px-8 py-4 bg-white text-blue-900 font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-blue-50 transition-colors\">邮件咨询</a><a class=\"px-8 py-4 border-2 border-white text-white font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors\" href=\"/contact\">在线留言</a>